<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Analysis>
    <Title>Process Monitor - Universal</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[This Analysis will report on information related&nbsp;processes monitoroed by the BigFix Agent.
<P>To define a process as, "Monitored" for use by this fixlet:</P>
<OL>
<LI>Create a client setting: besprocessmonitor-&lt;name&gt;
<LI>Populate the setting with a semicolon separated list of services to monitor: "<FONT size=2>BESProxyAgent.exe;BESRelay.exe;BESGather.exe;BESPluginService.exe;BESRootServer.exe;BESWebReportsServer.exe"</FONT></LI></OL>
<P><FONT size=2>This action will then check those services to make sure they are running.</FONT></P>
<P>For general information or to report issues with C3 Inventory content please visit GitHub here: <A href="https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Inventory">https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Inventory</A></P>]]></Description>
    <Relevance>windows of operating system</Relevance>
    <Relevance>exists settings whose (name of it starts with &quot;besprocessmonitor-&quot;) of client</Relevance>
    <Domain>BESC</Domain>
    <Property ID="1" Name="Process Monitor - Configuration - Universal" EvaluationPeriod="PT1H">unique values of ((it as trimmed string) of substrings separated by &quot;;&quot; of concatenations &quot;;&quot; whose (it != &quot;&quot;) of values of settings whose (name of it starts with &quot;besprocessmonitor-&quot;) of client)</Property>
    <Property ID="4" Name="Process Monitor - Processes Failing to Start - Windows" EvaluationPeriod="PT5M">if (uptime of operating system &gt; (value of settings &quot;besprocessmonitor-audit-delay&quot; of client as integer | 5) * minute) then (elements of (set of (substrings separated by &quot;;&quot; of concatenations &quot;;&quot; whose (it != &quot;&quot;) of values of settings whose (name of it starts with &quot;besprocessmonitor-&quot; and name of it does not start with &quot;besprocessmonitor-settings-&quot;) of client as lowercase) - set of (names of processes as lowercase))) else (nothing)</Property>
    <Property ID="7" Name="Process Monitor - Audit Delay - Windows" EvaluationPeriod="PT5M">value of settings &quot;besprocessmonitor-audit-delay&quot; of client as integer | 5</Property>
  </Analysis>
</BES>
